        "has_content_in_snapshot": true,
        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Given the function <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x) = 4x^3,]</span> find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x]</span> for which <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x) = 108.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Given the function [MATH: f(x) = 4x^3,] find the value of [MATH: x] for which [MATH: f(x) = 108.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We set <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x)]</span> equal to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 108]</span> and solve the obtained equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x,]</span> as follows:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x)|= 108; 4x^{3}|= 108; x^{3}|= 27; x^{3}|= 3^{3}; x|= 3]</span></p><p>Therefore, the required value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We set [MATH: f(x)] equal to [MATH: 108] and solve the obtained equation for [MATH: x,] as follows:\n\n[MATH: f(x)|= 108; 4x^{3}|= 108; x^{3}|= 27; x^{3}|= 3^{3}; x|= 3]\n\nTherefore, the required value of [MATH: x] is [MATH: 3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nGiven the function [MATH: f(x) = 4x^3,] find the value of [MATH: x] for which [MATH: f(x) = 108.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe set [MATH: f(x)] equal to [MATH: 108] and solve the obtained equation for [MATH: x,] as follows:\n\n[MATH: f(x)|= 108; 4x^{3}|= 108; x^{3}|= 27; x^{3}|= 3^{3}; x|= 3]\n\nTherefore, the required value of [MATH: x] is [MATH: 3.]"
      },
